  dialogueManager: {fileID: 1206789762}
  dialogueLines:
  - Help the cat find a way out!
  - First of all, the cat needs to  leave the room...
  - Collect Puzzle pieces...
  - You can open Inventory by tapping Bag Icon...
  - ...or pause the game on Collar Icon...
  - Use Arrow Buttons to move and INTERACT to interact...
  - The Cat can jump on UP ARROW...
  - Try jumping on a furniture.
